    "answer": {
      "short": "No solution: $2$ is outside the range $[-1,1]$ of $y=\\sin\\theta$.",
      "worked": "For every real $\\theta$, $-1\\leq\\sin\\theta\\leq1$. Since $2>1$, no values of $\\theta$ satisfy $\\sin\\theta=2$.",
